growth company <span id="xdx_909_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240104__20240104_zw5O451XtCy"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-01-04" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

